WEBVTT

00:17:59.586 --> 00:18:00.970
I was really nervous.

00:18:00.994 --> 00:18:03.648
I let my feet out,
and I started floating to the top.

00:18:03.672 --> 00:18:05.179
And I didn't take my head out.

00:18:05.203 --> 00:18:08.139
But I was just floating there
waiting for my heart to stop,

00:18:08.163 --> 00:18:09.163
just waiting.

00:18:09.187 --> 00:18:12.976
They had doctors with the "Pst,"
you know, sitting there waiting.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.543
And then suddenly I hear screaming.

00:18:15.567 --> 00:18:17.677
And I think that there
is some weird thing --

00:18:17.701 --> 00:18:19.976
that I had died or something had happened.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:23.976
And then I realized
that I had made it to 16:32.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.976
So, with the energy
of everybody that was there,

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.976
I decided to keep pushing.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.446
And I went to 17 minutes and four seconds.